# Docker build context for pipelines image: exclude everything except what the Dockerfile needs
.git
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.dagster
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
*.egg-info
.idea
*.log
*.md
!pipelines/README.md
# Exclude other workspace members not needed by pipelines
service
notebooks
xlake
agents
evals
web
third_party
docs
*.docx
.qodo
pipelines/tests
pipelines/.dagster-dev
pipelines/_data
